# Dev binaries: `task build` puts them here (architecture §2.1); a bare
# `go build ./cmd/moox` / `./cmd/tt` drops them at the module root (F6).
/bin/
/moox
/tt

# GoReleaser output, and the version stamp its `before` hook writes (§9.1).
/dist/
/share/moox/VERSION

# The two fixtures the tt suite needs (architecture §2.2 step 5). The
# repository-wide *.key rule and cmd/tt's .claude/ rule would drop them; both
# are synthetic (the .key holds a "never open me" sentence, no key material).
!internal/observer/testdata/registry/*.key
!internal/observer/testdata/jobs/decoy-nested/**
